<view class="page"><view class="brand"><image class="brand-icon" mode="aspectFit" src="/assets/vi-mark.png"/><view><text class="brand-name">乡桥</text><text class="small muted">连接乡土，共享丰收</text></view></view><text class="title">一个账号，多个身份。</text>
 <view wx:if="{{backend}}" class="surface gap"><text class="heading">本地 PostgreSQL 联调登录</text><text class="small muted">此处连接真实本地数据库，不读演示草稿。测试密码入口仅用于本机开发。</text><input class="input gap" placeholder="账号" data-field="username" value="{{username}}" bindinput="credential"/><input class="input gap" password="true" placeholder="密码" data-field="password" value="{{password}}" bindinput="credential"/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="small gap">{{error}}</view><button class="primary gap" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="serverLogin">登录数据库工作台</button><button class="gap" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="wechatLogin">微信登录（需服务端配置）</button><button class="gap" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="demoMode">退出联调，返回原型演示</button></view>
 <block wx:else><view class="intro muted">选择演示账号。生产版使用微信验证后，由服务端返回已批准的主体和身份。</view>
 <view class="surface"><text class="heading">体验不同角色</text><button wx:for="{{accounts}}" wx:key="id" class="row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose"><view class="row-copy"><text>{{item.name}}</text><view class="small muted">{{item.roles}}</view></view><text wx:if="{{selected === item.id}}" class="pill">已选</text></button></view>
 <checkbox-group bindchange="acknowledge" class="gap"><label class="small"><checkbox value="demo" checked="{{acknowledged}}" color="#0F3D2E"/>我已了解：仅本地演示，未登录真实账号，不付款、不签约。</label></checkbox-group>
 <button class="primary gap" bindtap="enter" disabled="{{!acknowledged}}">进入演示工作台</button><button class="gap" bindtap="backendMode">本地数据库联调</button><view class="demo-foot">不是微信授权登录，不收集手机号</view></block></view>
